+   `Worktree#branch(): Git.Branch` → `currentBranch(): Stale[Optional[Git.Branch]]` (или
+   `head(): Stale[Git.Head]`, новый, где `Git.Head` — это
+   `Attached(branch: Git.Branch, tip: Optional[Git.Hash])` или `Detached(at: Git.Hash)`);
+   `tags(): List[Git.Tag]` → `tags(): Stale[Map[Git.Tag, Git.Hash]]` (очищенные коммиты);
+   `reflog(ref: Optional[Refspec]): List[ReflogEntry]` →
+   `reflog(ref: Optional[Git.Ref]): Stale[List[ReflogEntry]]`; `remotes(): List[Remote]` →
+   `remotes(): Stale[List[Remote]]`; `worktrees(): List[Worktree]` →
+   `worktrees(): Stale[List[Git.Worktree.Entry]]` с
+   `Entry(path: Path on Linux, head: Optional[Git.Hash], branch: Optional[Git.Branch], bare: Boolean, locked: Optional[Text], prunable: Optional[Text])`;
+   `Worktree#status(ignored): List[Git.PathStatus]` →
+   `status(ignored: Boolean = false, untracked: Boolean = true): Stale[List[Git.PathStatus[worktree.Plane]]]`;
+   `Worktree#diff(staged)` → `diff(): Stale[List[FileDiff]]` и
+   `diffStaged(): Stale[List[FileDiff]]`; `Worktree#diff(ref)` →
